   102	
   103	**What reproduces.** Their central thesis, with room to spare: SKILL.state does not fail
   104	**once in 75 episodes** of up to 200 steps. It is the only arm with zero degradation;
   105	theirs loses six points. With this model, which does not hold on the second one (below).
   106	
   107	**What does not.** The magnitude, and only for ReAct: it loses 0.080 where theirs loses
